{
  "title": "Robinhood Lighter overview",
  "uid": "robinhood-lighter-overview",
  "tags": [
    "pairtrade",
    "bot",
    "robinhood"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "z-score + position state (freq / b)",
      "description": "Combined view: signed z-score lines plus abs(z), exit band lines at +/-0.2, and per-variant position-state bars overlaid at fixed Y levels (freq=3.0, b=2.5). Position bars are `(pairtrade_has_position == 1) * Y_offset` rendered as thick step lines so the same panel timeline aligns z and position on identical x-pixels. Robinhood Lighter runs a 2-arm split (bot-strategy#798/#834): freq = $5,000 points-volume incumbent, b = $3,000 defensive challenger (higher entry threshold, hold-time beta-floor exit). Both currently run the same 1h force_close / 30x profile after b's original wider/slower clone was reverted 2026-08-21.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pairtrade_z{instance=~\"debot-robinhood.*\",variant!=\"\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{variant}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "(pairtrade_has_position{instance=~\"debot-robinhood.*\",variant=\"freq\"} == 1) * 3.0",
          "legendFormat": "freq pos",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "(pairtrade_has_position{instance=~\"debot-robinhood.*\",variant=\"b\"} == 1) * 2.5",
          "legendFormat": "b pos",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "expr": "abs(pairtrade_z{instance=~\"debot-robinhood.*\",variant!=\"\"})",
          "legendFormat": "abs {{variant}}",
          "refId": "D"
        },
        {
          "expr": "vector(0.2)",
          "legendFormat": "exit_z band +0.2",
          "refId": "E"
        },
        {
          "expr": "vector(-0.2)",
          "legendFormat": "exit_z band -0.2",
          "refId": "F"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": -4,
          "max": 4,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "axisWidth": 120
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^freq.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^b( |$)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*pos$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineInterpolation",
                "value": "stepAfter"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 30
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.spanNulls",
                "value": false
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^abs.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineInterpolation",
                "value": "stepAfter"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^exit_z band.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Relative beta_gap = |beta_s - beta_l| / beta_eff (gate 0.30)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pairtrade_beta_gap_relative{instance=~\"debot-robinhood.*\",variant!=\"\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{variant}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.3
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Relative beta divergence = |beta_s - beta_l| / beta_eff. This is the value the entry filter compares against `beta_divergence_max` (0.30) — exceeding the red line hard-blocks entries, and `beta_gap_entry_z_scale` linearly raises the entry-z threshold even below it."
    },
