    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Per-leg slippage p50/p90 (bps, by variant / order_type)",
      "description": "Median + 90th-percentile slippage vs decision-time reference price, signed positive = cost. post_only fills typically hover near 0; taker fills are the adverse tail. Aggregated by variant as well as order_type so a regression on one arm (e.g. the challenger) isn't diluted by the other.",
